    {
      "name": "04 · 场景C · APP解绑",
      "description": "场景C：APP 用户解绑设备。\n\n执行顺序：C1 → C2 → C3\n\n最新 API 变更（已对齐）：\n- C1: DELETE /v1/device-bindings/{device_sn}（原 /current?device_sn= 已废弃，无需 body）\n- C3: GET /v1/device-bindings/{device_sn} → 404 RESOURCE_ACCESS_DENIED（原无明确 code）\n\n副作用：\n- C1 后 binding_version 递增, binding 标记 detached\n- 设备现有 device_access_token 立即失效\n- 设备下次调用任何 /v1/device/* → 401 AUTH_CREDENTIAL_INVALID\n\n【单接口测试】\n- C1 依赖：user_access_token（来自 01.login）\n- C2 依赖：device_access_token（来自 A1 或 B3）\n- C3 依赖：user_access_token（来自 01.login）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "C1 · DELETE /v1/device-bindings/{device_sn} (User 解绑)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{user_access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/device-bindings/{{device_sn}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1","device-bindings","{{device_sn}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [{
            "listen": "test",
            "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
              "pm.test('DELETE binding returns 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
              "console.log('✅ 解绑成功，设备 token 立即失效');"
            ]}
          }]
        },
        {
          "name": "C2 · 验证：设备旧 token 已失效 (GET bootstrap → 401)",
